{
  "nodes": [
    {"id":"defint-title","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":1800,"height":180,"text":"# 定积分与应用\n\n[[01_Math/01_calculus/03_定积分与应用|连续阅读：从累积到计算与建模]] · [[01_Math/01_calculus/03_Definite_Integrals|完整课堂记录与练习]]\n\n每张卡打开一个共享原子；沿有文字的箭头读推导或用途。颜色区分本图的语义角色，不表示掌握度。","color":"4"},
    {"id":"defint-guide","type":"text","x":2050,"y":0,"width":1800,"height":180,"text":"## 先辨清两种基本定理\n\nMIT 的 FTC I 是 [[Newton-Leibniz公式|原函数端点评价]]；FTC II 是 [[积分求导定理|累积后求导]]。课程先使用 I，再借助 II 证明它。\n\n复用：[[原函数]] · [[原函数相差常数]] · [[链式法则]] · [[极值定理]] · [[介值定理]]"},
    {"id":"g-accum","type":"group","x":0,"y":260,"width":1800,"height":900,"label":"1 · 从有限和到累积规则"},
    {"id":"a001","type":"text","x":40,"y":350,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[黎曼和]]\n采样高度 × 小段宽度，再相加。","color":"4"},
    {"id":"a002","type":"text","x":660,"y":350,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[定积分]]\n所有充分细采样和的共同极限。","color":"4"},
    {"id":"a003","type":"text","x":1280,"y":350,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[连续函数可积]]\n有限闭区间上的连续性保证极限存在。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"a009","type":"text","x":40,"y":640,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[和式识别为积分]]\n找出宽度、采样点与区间；保留缩放。","color":"3"},
    {"id":"a004","type":"text","x":660,"y":640,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[定积分线性性]]\n常系数的和可以逐项积分。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"a005","type":"text","x":1280,"y":640,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[定积分区间可加性]]\n同起点的累积相减得到 [[变限积分求导|双变限表达式]]。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"a008","type":"text","x":40,"y":930,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[净变化与总变化]]\n位移允许抵消；路程先取速度绝对值。","color":"1"},
    {"id":"a006","type":"text","x":660,"y":930,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[积分保序性]]\n正向区间保留两函数的逐点高低。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"a007","type":"text","x":1280,"y":930,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[积分绝对值界]]\n净累积的大小不超过无抵消的累积。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"g-ftc","type":"group","x":2050,"y":260,"width":1800,"height":900,"label":"2 · 两个基本定理与积分定义的函数"},
    {"id":"a011","type":"text","x":2090,"y":350,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[累积函数]]\n固定起点，终点变动；初值为零。","color":"4"},
    {"id":"a012","type":"text","x":2710,"y":350,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[积分求导定理]]\n连续被积函数的末端高度给累积变化率。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"a013","type":"text","x":3330,"y":350,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[Newton-Leibniz公式]]\n同导数只差常数，因此积分由端点相减。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"a014","type":"text","x":2090,"y":640,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[变限积分求导]]\n上端贡献减下端贡献，各带链式因子。","color":"3"},
    {"id":"a015","type":"text","x":2710,"y":640,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[积分上下界估计]]\n先确定可积性，再找全区间比较函数。","color":"3"},
    {"id":"a016","type":"text","x":3330,"y":640,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[积分中值定理]]\n连续性让积分平均高度被实际取到。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"a017","type":"text","x":2090,"y":930,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[自然对数积分表示]]\n1/t 的累积与 [[自然对数|已有 ln]] 同导数、同初值。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"a018","type":"text","x":2710,"y":930,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[累积函数图像]]\n被积函数的符号定增减，增减定凹凸。","color":"3"},
    {"id":"a019","type":"text","x":3330,"y":930,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[无初等原函数的积分]]\n表达式受限，不妨碍存在、求导或近似。","color":"1"},
    {"id":"g-geo","type":"group","x":0,"y":1340,"width":1800,"height":690,"label":"3 · 几何积分先认清实际微元"},
    {"id":"a020","type":"text","x":40,"y":1430,"width":440,"height":150,"text":"## [[曲线间面积]]\n同一切片上，上减下或右减左。","color":"3"},
    {"id":"a021","type":"text","x":660,"y":1430,"width":440,"height":150,"text":"## [[切片体积]]\n实际截面积 × 厚度，再累积。","color":"3"},
    {"id":"a022","type":"text","x":1280,"y":1430,"width":440,"height":150,"text":"## [[圆盘垫圈法]]\n垂直旋转轴切片，外圆减内孔。","color":"3"},
    {"id":"a030","type":"text","x":40,"y":1790,"width":440,"height":150,"text":"## [[Pappus体积定理]]\n区域在轴一侧：面积 × 形心一周路程。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"a023","type":"text","x":660,"y":1790,"width":440,"height":150,"text":"## [[圆柱壳法]]\n平行旋转轴切条，按非负半径分层。","color":"3"},
    {"id":"a024","type":"text","x":1280,"y":1790,"width":440,"height":150,"text":"## [[旋转体重复覆盖]]\n相同半径的轴向交叠只能计一次。","color":"1"},
    {"id":"g-weight","type":"group","x":2050,"y":1340,"width":1800,"height":690,"label":"4 · 平均、质量和力各自决定微元"},
    {"id":"a025","type":"text","x":2090,"y":1430,"width":440,"height":150,"text":"## [[积分平均值]]\n总累积除以区间长度，是平均高度。","color":"4"},
    {"id":"a026","type":"text","x":2710,"y":1430,"width":440,"height":150,"text":"## [[加权平均]]\n非负权重下，总加权量除以总权重。","color":"4"},
    {"id":"a027","type":"text","x":3330,"y":1430,"width":440,"height":150,"text":"## [[质心]]\n位置按质量加权；均匀薄片时等于形心。","color":"4"},
    {"id":"arc-reuse","type":"text","x":2090,"y":1790,"width":440,"height":150,"text":"## [[参数曲线弧长与重复描画|弧长微元]]\n曲线平均使用 ds；沿 x 均匀不等于沿弧长均匀。"},
    {"id":"a029","type":"text","x":2710,"y":1790,"width":440,"height":150,"text":"## [[功的积分]]\n力分量 × 有向位移；沿行程按 [[定积分区间可加性|分段相加]] 累积。","color":"3"},
    {"id":"a028","type":"text","x":3330,"y":1790,"width":440,"height":150,"text":"## [[质心积分计算]]\n切片先算总质量，再算两个一阶矩。","color":"3"},
    {"id":"g-num","type":"group","x":0,"y":2210,"width":1800,"height":900,"label":"5 · 数值近似与可保证的误差"},
    {"id":"a031","type":"text","x":40,"y":2300,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[左右端点矩形法]]\n同一网格，选择左端或右端高度。","color":"3"},
    {"id":"a033","type":"text","x":660,"y":2300,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[梯形法]]\n用相邻样本之间的直线近似。","color":"3"},
    {"id":"a036","type":"text","x":1280,"y":2300,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[梯形积分误差界]]\nC² 与全区间二阶导数界给二阶控制。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"a032","type":"text","x":40,"y":2590,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[中点法]]\n每一小段使用中点高度。","color":"3"},
    {"id":"a035","type":"text","x":660,"y":2590,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[Simpson组合恒等式]]\n粗网格梯形与中点组合生成细网格 Simpson。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"a037","type":"text","x":1280,"y":2590,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[中点积分误差界]]\nC² 下常数为 1/24；仍需整个区间的界。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"num-guide","type":"text","x":40,"y":2880,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## 网格与证书\nN 是小区间数，h=(b−a)/N；步数翻倍改变误差界，不保证实际误差严格同比。"},
    {"id":"a034","type":"text","x":660,"y":2880,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[Simpson法]]\n偶数段、1–4–2–…–4–1 权重。","color":"3"},
    {"id":"a038","type":"text","x":1280,"y":2880,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[Simpson误差界]]\nC⁴ 与四阶导数界给四阶控制。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"g-gauss","type":"group","x":2050,"y":2210,"width":1800,"height":900,"label":"6 · 高斯积分把几何与概率接起来"},
    {"id":"a010","type":"text","x":2090,"y":2300,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[奇偶函数积分]]\n可积性先成立，对称区间再抵消或加倍。","color":"3"},
    {"id":"a039","type":"text","x":2710,"y":2300,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[高斯积分]]\n有限方形与圆盘夹逼，得到 √π 并证明收敛。","color":"5"},
    {"id":"density","type":"text","x":3330,"y":2300,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[概率密度函数]]\n非负与总积分为一共同决定概率解释。","color":"4"},
    {"id":"improper","type":"text","x":2090,"y":2590,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[反常积分]]\n无限区间先截断，两侧尾积分分别取极限。","color":"4"},
    {"id":"cdf","type":"text","x":2710,"y":2590,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[累积分布函数]]\n一般定义是 P(X≤x)；有密度时才由密度累积。","color":"4"},
    {"id":"expect","type":"text","x":3330,"y":2590,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[期望]]\n按概率权重平均；有限值需一阶绝对矩。","color":"4"},
    {"id":"substitution","type":"text","x":2090,"y":2880,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[定积分换元]]\n[[高斯积分|缩放高斯指数得到一般系数]]；需逆映射时另查 [[非单调换元需分支]]。"},
    {"id":"finish","type":"text","x":2710,"y":2880,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## 回到课程问题\n[[01_Math/01_calculus/03_定积分与应用|完整阅读与自检]]\n未归一化的曲线下面积不能直接称概率。"},
    {"id":"variance","type":"text","x":3330,"y":2880,"width":440,"height":140,"text":"## [[方差]]\n按概率权重累积偏离均值的平方。","color":"4"}
  ],
  "edges": [
    {"id":"e01","fromNode":"a001","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a002","toSide":"left","label":"共同细网格极限"},
    {"id":"e02","fromNode":"a003","fromSide":"left","toNode":"a002","toSide":"right","label":"保证存在"},
    {"id":"e03","fromNode":"a001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a009","toSide":"top","label":"反向识别宽度与采样"},
    {"id":"e04","fromNode":"a002","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a004","toSide":"top","label":"分配律保留到极限"},
    {"id":"e06","fromNode":"a006","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a007","toSide":"left","label":"积分 −|f|≤f≤|f|"},
    {"id":"e07","fromNode":"a007","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a008","toSide":"bottom","label":"路程不小于位移大小"},
    {"id":"e08","fromNode":"a011","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a012","toSide":"left","label":"连续性控制差商误差"},
    {"id":"e09","fromNode":"a012","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a013","toSide":"left","label":"同导数差常数"},
    {"id":"e10","fromNode":"a011","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a014","toSide":"top","label":"先累积求导，再乘链式因子"},
    {"id":"e11","fromNode":"a015","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a016","toSide":"left","label":"界内平均值由连续性取到"},
    {"id":"e14","fromNode":"a019","fromSide":"left","toNode":"a018","toSide":"right","label":"仍可求导研究图像"},
    {"id":"e15","fromNode":"a020","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a021","toSide":"left","label":"高度换成截面积"},
    {"id":"e16","fromNode":"a021","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a022","toSide":"left","label":"旋转截面是圆或圆环"},
    {"id":"e17","fromNode":"a021","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a023","toSide":"top","label":"改按半径分层"},
    {"id":"e18","fromNode":"a023","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a024","toSide":"left","label":"每个实际壳层只计一次"},
    {"id":"e19","fromNode":"a024","fromSide":"top","toNode":"a022","toSide":"bottom","label":"可改算实际截面并集"},
    {"id":"e20","fromNode":"a023","fromSide":"left","toNode":"a030","toSide":"right","label":"一阶面积矩写成 A × 轴距"},
    {"id":"e21","fromNode":"a025","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a026","toSide":"left","label":"常权重推广到非负权重"},
    {"id":"e22","fromNode":"a026","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a027","toSide":"left","label":"位置以质量加权"},
    {"id":"e23","fromNode":"a027","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a028","toSide":"top","label":"坐标矩转成切片积分"},
    {"id":"e24","fromNode":"arc-reuse","fromSide":"top","toNode":"a025","toSide":"bottom","label":"沿曲线平均用 ds / L"},
    {"id":"e25","fromNode":"a031","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a033","toSide":"left","label":"左右规则取平均"},
    {"id":"e26","fromNode":"a033","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a036","toSide":"left","label":"补 C² 和导数界"},
    {"id":"e27","fromNode":"a032","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a035","toSide":"left","label":"中点权重为 2"},
    {"id":"e28","fromNode":"a033","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a035","toSide":"top","label":"粗网格梯形权重为 1"},
    {"id":"e29","fromNode":"a035","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a034","toSide":"top","label":"S₂ₙ=(Tₙ+2Mₙ)/3"},
    {"id":"e30","fromNode":"a037","fromSide":"top","toNode":"a036","toSide":"bottom","toEnd":"none","label":"同阶二阶界，常数不同"},
    {"id":"e31","fromNode":"a034","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a038","toSide":"left","label":"补 C⁴ 和偶数段条件"},
    {"id":"e32","fromNode":"a010","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a039","toSide":"left","label":"偶性连接全线与半线"},
    {"id":"e33","fromNode":"improper","fromSide":"top","toNode":"a039","toSide":"bottom","label":"全线积分须分别检查两侧尾部"},
    {"id":"e34","fromNode":"a039","fromSide":"right","toNode":"density","toSide":"left","label":"积分值确定归一化常数"},
    {"id":"e35","fromNode":"density","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"cdf","toSide":"top","label":"有密度时积分到 x"},
    {"id":"e36","fromNode":"density","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"expect","toSide":"top","label":"乘取值并检查可积性"},
    {"id":"e37","fromNode":"expect","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"variance","toSide":"top","label":"对中心化平方取期望"}
  ]
